// PINS: the implicit `expr` remap + an explicit `expr:` label land on the
// same parameter — `~test(first thing, expr: and a second)` compiled and
// emitted only "first thing" (measured 2026-09-24). The positional binding
// and the label collide; one is silently dropped. Refuse.
~import std/testing

~test(first thing, expr: and a second) {
    ~assert.ok()
}
